cutadapt 5.3.dev15+g50e9fb8d3
N3 doc snippet on CGTACGTACGAAAAAAAAAAAA: returns 'CGTACGTACGAAAAAAAAAAAA'; shipped poly_a_trim_index -> 'CGTACGTACG'
